Version 2.0
MONITORING TOOL WITH FALCO
=============================
The tool mainly monitors and responds to suspicious activity within Docker containers, using Falco with eBPF
and Python.
It evaluates events, generate alerts, isolate containers, and enable their recovery.

---------------------------------------------------

DECISION MAKING
=============================
The file to define the response policies is located in policy.yaml
A Python-based engine was developed to analyze events received from Falco and determine the action the system should take.
There are 3 actions

IGNORE (Events that does not require attention)
ALERT (Register and notifies when a suspicious activity takes place)
ISOLATE (Execute the container isolation)

There is also an allowlist: Allows the exclusion of containers and images considered trusted,to reduce unnecessary alerts.
Allows to isolate a container when the same rule is activated a certain number of times within a time window.

-------------------------------------------------------
